{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "028ab3d5-3190-804a-b7dc-a839d40cb660",
  "created_at": "2026-01-25T10:56:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nora Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:53:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:53:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hi. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, so I called the storm line, the number on the website. Is this the right place for plowing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:53:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:53:37-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so I'm at 341 Eustis Avenue, up on the Hill. The snow's turning to rain, I can see that, but there's this heavy wet pile at the end of our walk where the plow came through, and the street's still, um, kind of a mess. And my neighbor, she's elderly, she lives right next door, she can't get out. She can't get over it. She's got appointments and, hang on. Mason, not now, I'm on the phone. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:54:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. So the plow left a bank across her walk or her driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:54:10-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Her driveway and the curb cut, both. It's like a wall. She'd need a path to the street, even just one car wide, or a way to get to the sidewalk. And, can you send sand? Is there any way to get sand? Because with the rain freezing later it's going to be, I mean, it's slick already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me put that down. I can log it as a plow request for the street and a sand request for that block. Is the street itself passable, or is it just her driveway end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:54:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street's passable. Just the, the edge. The bank at the edge. Mason, I said wait. Sorry, what was the question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:54:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street's drivable, the problem is the bank at her driveway and the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:54:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:54:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll flag it as an access issue for an older resident, which helps with priority. I can't give you a time, crews are stretched thin with the storm still going. But it goes to the sanding and plow list now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:55:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I just, we have a school assembly this afternoon, my son's class is performing, so I'll be out of the house around one. I wanted to get it in before I go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:55:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Do you want a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:55:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0176."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:55:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0176, Nora, 341 Eustis Avenue. Is that the neighbor's side, the east or west side of you, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:55:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Uh, it's the left side if you're facing the house from the street. The left. I think that's east, honestly I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:55:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Left side facing the house is plenty. I'll note that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:55:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thank you. Thanks so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Tell her to stay put until it's clear, and have a good assembly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T10:56:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
